g(x) = (x + 2)>x in part (b) except at x = 1, where ƒ is undefined. The functions have the same limit as x S 1 (Example 7)."},{"x":0.65132,"y":0.45908,"w":0.12205,"h":0.08776,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"2x2 + 100 - 10"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.52207,"w":0.2876,"h":0.01687,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Example 8 Estimate the value of lim"},{"x":0.70683,"y":0.52425,"w":0.07233,"h":0.02316,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"x2 ."},{"x":0.62738,"y":0.53461,"w":0.0239,"h":0.01206,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"xS0"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.55788,"w":0.59308,"h":0.04714,"fs":0.01407,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Solution Table 2.3 lists values of the function obtained on a calculator for several points approaching x = 0. As x approaches 0 through the points {1, {0.5, {0.10, and {0.01, the function seems to approach the number 0.05."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.60221,"w":0.59302,"h":0.03351,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"As we take even smaller values of x, {0.0005, {0.0001, {0.00001, and {0.000001, the function appears to approach the number 0."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.63679,"w":0.5929,"h":0.02962,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Is the answer 0.05 or 0, or some other value? We resolve this question in the next example."},{"x":0.38221,"y":0.65163,"w":0.39338,"h":0.08837,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Table 2.3 Computed values of ƒ(x) = 2x 2 + 100 - 10"},{"x":0.70722,"y":0.71133,"w":0.14896,"h":0.02356,"fs":0.01183,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"x 2 near x = 0"},{"x":0.38221,"y":0.74151,"w":0.14329,"h":0.01526,"fs":0.01215,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"x ƒ(x)"},{"x":0.38465,"y":0.77126,"w":0.16964,"h":0.07503,"fs":0.01786,"n":8,"k":0,"t":"{1 0.049876 {0.5 0.049969 {0.1 0.049999 {0.01 0.050000"},{"x":0.55838,"y":0.802,"w":0.12805,"h":0.01427,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"t approaches 0.05?"},{"x":0.38464,"y":0.84799,"w":0.17049,"h":0.07503,"fs":0.01279,"n":8,"k":0,"t":"{0.0005 0.050000 {0.0001 0.000000 {0.00001 0.000000 {0.000001 0.000000"},{"x":0.55922,"y":0.87874,"w":0.11251,"h":0.01427,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"t approaches 0?"}]}